WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:50.739
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:51.009 --> 00:52.677
Whatever Mama Yaya has planned,

3
00:52.761 --> 00:54.220
I'll leave that up to her.

4
00:54.304 --> 00:57.098
If there's one thing I've learned all these years,

5
00:57.599 --> 01:01.311
it's that love is ultimately a decision.

6
01:02.812 --> 01:04.939
Mikoy, Chiara is missing.

7
01:05.023 --> 01:07.108
-She's not in the bridal car either. -Are you sure?

8
01:07.192 --> 01:09.069
Maybe she just went to the bathroom.

9
01:09.152 --> 01:10.445
That's possible, but…

10
01:10.528 --> 01:11.654
I'll go look for Chiara.

11
01:11.738 --> 01:13.948
-Let's go check! -What's happening?

12
01:14.574 --> 01:16.785
-Hey! -Wait, Mikoy!

13
01:20.121 --> 01:23.583
Don't you have any leads or information from your informants?

14
01:23.666 --> 01:26.085
Maybe she's just a runaway bride.

15
01:26.169 --> 01:27.587
Besides, Mario,

16
01:27.670 --> 01:31.132
it's no longer news that the bride used to be part of the mafia.

17
01:31.216 --> 01:33.218
Maybe she went back to her old life.

18
01:34.177 --> 01:36.054
We also spoke to Donabel and Viktor.

19
01:36.137 --> 01:38.640
The family even talked before Chiara left the hotel.

20
01:38.723 --> 01:42.560
We also spoke to everyone who came into contact with Chiara.

21
01:42.644 --> 01:44.771
None of them noticed anything unusual.

22
01:44.854 --> 01:47.232
In fact, they all said the same thing.

23
01:47.315 --> 01:52.153
That Chiara was a beautiful and excited bride.

24
01:55.990 --> 01:59.202
Yes, sir. Viktor and Donabel are with us right now.

25
01:59.786 --> 02:01.996
We'll be leaving soon as well.

26
02:04.791 --> 02:07.293
I'll arrange for additional escorts

27
02:07.377 --> 02:10.421
for your trip back to Manila to make sure you're all safe.

28
02:11.005 --> 02:12.382
-Thank you, sir. -Thank you, sir.

29
02:12.465 --> 02:13.675
Take care.

30
02:14.259 --> 02:16.136
With Chiara suddenly disappearing,

31
02:16.219 --> 02:20.306
we can't completely rule out a connection between

32
02:33.862 --> 02:35.905
Where could Chiara be?

33
02:36.531 --> 02:39.659
What if that was the last time we ever saw Chiara?

34
02:39.742 --> 02:41.244
Don't say that, Dekyo.

35
02:42.495 --> 02:44.706
We may not know where Chiara is,

36
02:45.790 --> 02:48.001
but I'm sure she's perfectly safe wherever she is right now.

37
02:48.751 --> 02:49.794
That's right.

38
02:49.878 --> 02:52.213
Besides, she used to be a world-class assassin.

39
02:52.297 --> 02:55.633
She can definitely defend herself against kidnappers.

40
02:56.634 --> 02:57.510
Yes.

41
02:57.594 --> 02:59.137
You're already talking about kidnappers, and we don't even have

42
02:59.220 --> 03:00.763
any clear information yet.

43
03:01.431 --> 03:06.060
So let's take it easy with our thoughts and our reactions.

44
03:06.728 --> 03:08.730
I know we're all worried about Chiara,

45
03:08.813 --> 03:10.064
but of course, we should just

46
03:10.940 --> 03:12.400
relax and stay calm.

47
03:12.483 --> 03:13.359
Okay.

48
03:13.443 --> 03:16.404
Of all the people whose wedding outfits I've sewn,

49
03:16.487 --> 03:17.989
Mikoy is the only one whose bride didn't show up.

50
03:18.072 --> 03:19.699
I don't know what happened.

51
03:19.782 --> 03:23.536
Remember, Chiara used to be part of the mafia.

52
03:23.620 --> 03:27.165
They say, once you're in a syndicate, you're always in a syndicate.

53
03:27.248 --> 03:28.166
That's how you see it.

54
03:28.249 --> 03:30.460
I mean, it's hard to get out.

55
03:30.543 --> 03:32.670
Do you think there's some unfinished business there?

56
03:33.338 --> 03:34.172
Oh, no.

57
03:34.255 --> 03:36.174
What if the rumors are true

58
03:36.257 --> 03:37.884
and Chiara was kidnapped?

59
03:41.596 --> 03:44.599
For now, just extend your stay there, Alex.

60
03:47.727 --> 03:49.604
Keep an eye on your surroundings.

61
03:49.687 --> 03:53.900
Maybe we're looking too far ahead when the answer is right within

62
03:53.983 --> 03:55.777
our peripheral vision.

63
03:57.237 --> 03:58.321
Besides,

64
03:59.030 --> 04:00.907
I have a feeling about this Rahmboy.

65
04:03.618 --> 04:05.745
Sir, Rahmboy? The vlogger?

66
04:05.828 --> 04:07.580
The aspiring content creator?

67
04:07.664 --> 04:08.873
Yes.

68
04:09.374 --> 04:10.667
He may look harmless,

69
04:10.750 --> 04:13.670
but if you look into his profile,

70
04:14.295 --> 04:15.380
it's like…

71
04:16.339 --> 04:17.924
it's too good to be true.

72
04:38.486 --> 04:41.572
I think it could be some kind of curse or witchcraft.

73
04:41.656 --> 04:43.491
Oh, please. I don't believe in that.

74
04:43.574 --> 04:47.495
It's more believable that she simply changed her mind.

75
04:47.578 --> 04:49.414
No, I don't think so.

76
04:49.497 --> 04:51.291
Chiara looked completely head over heels in love when she

77
04:51.374 --> 04:52.500
was trying on her gown.

78
04:53.084 --> 04:54.627
Sure, she may be in love now,

79
04:54.711 --> 04:57.338
but maybe she's having doubts about the future.

80
04:57.422 --> 04:59.215
Oh, come on, you guys.

81
04:59.882 --> 05:03.386
It's as if you've never experienced Chiara's kindness.

82
05:03.469 --> 05:06.055
You're gossiping about her nonstop.

83
05:06.639 --> 05:07.765
They are.

84
05:07.849 --> 05:08.933
You too!

85
05:09.517 --> 05:10.351
You know,

86
05:11.561 --> 05:14.314
none of us knows what really happened.

87
05:14.897 --> 05:16.774
So maybe the best thing we can do

88
05:16.858 --> 05:20.570
is pray together that Chiara is safe.

89
05:22.363 --> 05:24.949
We've already searched all over Albay,

90
05:25.033 --> 05:26.909
but we still haven't found Chiara.

91
05:26.993 --> 05:28.703
It's like she vanished into thin air.

92
05:28.786 --> 05:31.080
Exactly. So what if we can't find her because…

93
05:31.831 --> 05:33.291
She doesn't want to be found?

94
05:35.168 --> 05:36.044
That's impossible.

95
05:36.127 --> 05:39.505
What, do you think she actually planned not to show up at her own wedding?

96
05:39.589 --> 05:41.924
And leave Brother Mikoy standing there like an idiot, waiting at the altar?

97
05:42.008 --> 05:43.551
Chiara wouldn't do that.

98
05:45.928 --> 05:47.764
She wouldn't just leave me like that.

99
05:48.347 --> 05:50.141
Because we made a promise to each other.

100
05:50.933 --> 05:52.560
So will you please just stop?

101
05:52.643 --> 05:54.145
You're not helping.

102
05:55.271 --> 05:56.689
Chiara is missing,

103
05:56.773 --> 05:58.691
and she needs our help.

104
06:01.486 --> 06:02.987
I don't know where to start,

105
06:03.071 --> 06:06.324
but I won't stop until I bring her back here.

106
06:08.034 --> 06:09.619
Whatever happens, son,

107
06:09.702 --> 06:11.913
we're here to support you.

108
06:12.622 --> 06:15.166
But maybe you need to get some rest first.

109
06:15.249 --> 06:17.001
It's been a very long day.

110
06:17.085 --> 06:19.378
But Mom, we're wasting time.

111
06:19.462 --> 06:20.630
Mikoy.

112
06:20.713 --> 06:24.008
The agency and the local police are all helping us.

113
06:24.092 --> 06:25.968
I think Tess is right.

114
06:26.052 --> 06:27.261
-You should get some rest first. -Mom!

115
06:27.929 --> 06:31.390
Chiara could be in even more danger if we stop looking for her.

116
06:50.785 --> 06:51.828
Mikoy.

117
06:53.579 --> 06:54.997
I understand you.

118
06:56.207 --> 06:58.668
I won't judge you because your concerns are valid,

119
06:58.751 --> 07:00.837
as are your fears and worries.

120
07:02.004 --> 07:03.673
But I want you to know,

121
07:05.133 --> 07:07.135
we love Chiara too.

122
07:08.803 --> 07:10.263
And we're worried about her too.

123
07:13.057 --> 07:15.017
Maybe what we should do for now,

124
07:16.602 --> 07:18.438
while we wait for any news,

125
07:20.231 --> 07:22.024
is take care of each other.

126
07:23.192 --> 07:24.861
Wait?

127
07:24.944 --> 07:26.028
Dad!

128
07:26.654 --> 07:29.866
If the Concordat really had something to do with Chiara's disappearance,

129
07:30.491 --> 07:32.326
they're not the type to just sit around and wait.

130
07:32.410 --> 07:33.911
They're criminals!

131
07:33.995 --> 07:35.621
We're wasting time, Dad.

132
07:37.623 --> 07:39.959
But there's also a time to rest

133
07:40.042 --> 07:41.335
and regain your strength.

134
07:42.587 --> 07:43.963
I'm sorry

135
07:44.464 --> 07:47.550
if I don't have any good news for you,

136
07:47.633 --> 07:51.387
but I want you to know that we're all on your side.

137
07:52.430 --> 07:54.432
And all we want

138
07:55.850 --> 07:58.186
is for you and Chiara to be okay.

139
08:02.231 --> 08:03.566
I'm sorry, Dad.

140
08:05.985 --> 08:07.445
This is just so hard.

141
08:09.322 --> 08:10.281
It's okay.

142
08:12.116 --> 08:16.579
If I were in your position, I'd probably do the same thing.

143
08:17.288 --> 08:20.208
But you really need to get some rest, so tomorrow,

144
08:20.291 --> 08:22.418
we can resume the search.

145
08:22.502 --> 08:23.878
But Dad…

146
08:24.712 --> 08:25.713
Please.

147
08:25.796 --> 08:28.299
As your father, please grant me this.

148
08:29.425 --> 08:30.968
Get some rest.

149
08:31.052 --> 08:32.053
Even just for a while.

150
08:39.685 --> 08:40.978
Thank you, Dad.

151
08:43.523 --> 08:46.275
I just don't know what I'll do if something bad happens to Chiara.

152
08:46.359 --> 08:48.903
Nothing bad will happen to her.

153
08:50.655 --> 08:52.406
Just have faith, son.

154
09:13.135 --> 09:14.971
I've kept so many secrets

155
09:15.054 --> 09:20.059
just so I could give our family a simple and peaceful life, Mikoy.

156
09:21.269 --> 09:22.562
Sometimes,

157
09:22.645 --> 09:26.566
I feel like fate is making me pay for all those things.

158
09:28.651 --> 09:31.779
But how can I explain the thing that I saw earlier?

159
09:38.286 --> 09:41.247
Chiara. What are you doing?

160
09:41.330 --> 09:43.040
And where are you going?

161
09:53.426 --> 09:55.761
It's been so hard for me to keep this from you.

162
09:56.804 --> 09:58.723
But I promise you.

163
09:59.807 --> 10:02.184
I'll find out the truth, son.

164
10:08.065 --> 10:09.066
Hey!

165
10:09.150 --> 10:11.193
Our king is giving us the silent treatment.

166
10:11.777 --> 10:13.279
He comes and goes with authorization,

167
10:13.362 --> 10:14.822
then returns whenever he feels like it.

168
10:14.905 --> 10:16.532
Where did you go?

169
10:18.826 --> 10:20.036
Hey.

170
10:21.996 --> 10:22.830
Huh?

171
10:22.913 --> 10:24.874
You're acting more like gangsters than the inmates in there.

172
10:24.957 --> 10:26.667
Want me to put you inside?

173
10:26.751 --> 10:27.585
Huh?

174
10:27.668 --> 10:29.337
We're just disciplining him, sir.

175
10:29.420 --> 10:30.755
Disciplining him?

176
10:31.547 --> 10:33.049
Are you his father?

177
10:33.132 --> 10:33.966
His mother?

178
10:34.050 --> 10:38.179
Get out of my sight before I turn those uniforms of yours orange.

179
10:38.971 --> 10:39.972
Get out!

180
10:49.315 --> 10:50.524
I heard what happened,

181
10:52.193 --> 10:53.402
and I'm here to protect you.

182
11:04.372 --> 11:06.582
Is there still no news about my daughter?

183
11:07.917 --> 11:09.460
Not yet, for now.

184
11:09.960 --> 11:11.170
But don't worry.

185
11:11.253 --> 11:13.172
Agent Alex and the others are doing everything

186
11:13.255 --> 11:15.007
they can to find Chiara.

187
11:15.591 --> 11:17.176
I trust Agent Alex.

188
11:17.259 --> 11:18.928
She can find anything.

189
11:19.512 --> 11:20.930
After all, she found me.

190
11:22.765 --> 11:23.682
Anyway,

191
11:23.766 --> 11:26.352
I'll patrol around for now. The guards might get suspicious

192
11:26.435 --> 11:28.104
if they notice I'm keeping a close watch on you.

193
11:43.035 --> 11:46.038
It's not like Chiara to just vanish into thin air.

194
11:48.082 --> 11:49.250
I think something happened to her.

195
12:06.016 --> 12:07.101
Mikoy.

196
12:08.102 --> 12:09.603
Are you okay?

197
12:10.187 --> 12:15.192
Maybe you should get some rest first, you know.

198
12:16.068 --> 12:19.029
I won't rest until I find Chiara.

199
12:19.822 --> 12:24.160
Even Mario hasn't stopped looking for Chiara either.

200
12:24.660 --> 12:26.370
We can't find him either.

201
12:34.170 --> 12:38.424
Chiara. What are you and Vicky planning?

202
12:43.387 --> 12:45.931
Does Vicky have any other connection to Chiara?

203
12:46.724 --> 12:48.767
Other than being her nanny?

204
12:51.353 --> 12:54.356
Because it seems like my son is in danger again.

205
12:54.440 --> 12:59.278
I will ensure the safety of Mikoy and my family.

206
12:59.361 --> 13:01.280
I will find out the truth.

207
13:21.300 --> 13:23.469
I've done everything you asked me to do.

208
13:25.221 --> 13:26.514
I came here with you.

209
13:28.474 --> 13:31.143
What do you mean when you say Mikoy's life would be in danger

210
13:31.227 --> 13:32.520
if the wedding went through?

211
13:32.603 --> 13:33.729
What's going on?

212
13:34.313 --> 13:36.857
This is all Rio de Janyx's fault.

213
13:37.942 --> 13:42.571
I only found out that he planned to use Mikoy's life,

214
13:42.655 --> 13:43.739
his family,

215
13:43.822 --> 13:46.325
and even the people he loves against you

216
13:46.408 --> 13:48.494
if you went through with the marriage.

217
13:52.122 --> 13:53.916
He wants you, my child.

218
14:02.299 --> 14:03.801
I don't know him.

219
14:03.884 --> 14:05.970
He doesn't even know me.

220
14:06.053 --> 14:07.763
I've never even seen his face.

221
14:09.765 --> 14:13.602
You know how these things work with royal families.

222
14:21.652 --> 14:23.737
So if you become his wife,

223
14:23.821 --> 14:27.157
no one will challenge him or his position anymore.

224
14:27.783 --> 14:30.327
His position as the head of the Concordat will be secured.

225
14:30.411 --> 14:32.037
Is he crazy?

226
14:33.664 --> 14:34.790
Maybe.

227
14:40.254 --> 14:43.090
I'm not marrying him. Never!

228
14:44.508 --> 14:47.303
You need to become La Morte Bianca.

229
14:48.387 --> 14:50.806
You need to fulfill your promise.

230
14:50.890 --> 14:52.725
Take the throne.

231
14:55.477 --> 14:57.563
Didn't I already tell you?

232
14:58.522 --> 14:59.815
I don't want this anymore!

233
15:02.276 --> 15:04.570
So why are you forcing this on me?

234
15:05.154 --> 15:07.031
I'm not forcing you, my child.

235
15:13.287 --> 15:14.705
He's blackmailing you.

236
15:15.289 --> 15:16.790
To put an end to this,

237
15:16.874 --> 15:20.920
you have to kill the person he's using to blackmail you,

238
15:21.003 --> 15:23.005
or kill the blackmailer himself.

239
15:23.088 --> 15:24.131
You choose.

240
15:29.803 --> 15:32.056
There's too much happening.

241
15:33.599 --> 15:35.643
Isn't there a better way?

242
15:41.523 --> 15:42.816
But remember,

243
15:42.900 --> 15:46.236
once a mafia, always a mafia.

244
15:47.196 --> 15:51.492
You can't escape what's already been destined for you, my child.

245
16:15.975 --> 16:17.559
What do you mean you can't find Dad Mario?

246
16:17.643 --> 16:20.187
Yes, but he's probably just around here somewhere.

247
16:20.270 --> 16:22.648
He's asking the police questions,

248
16:22.731 --> 16:24.817
trying to get information, so, of course,

249
16:24.900 --> 16:26.694
he can find Chiara, right?

250
16:27.695 --> 16:29.196
What about the barangay watchmen?

251
16:29.279 --> 16:31.156
Didn't they notice anything unusual?

252
16:31.824 --> 16:35.160
Don't put too much faith in the people around here.

253
16:35.244 --> 16:37.621
Ever since they heard that Chiara went missing,

254
16:37.705 --> 16:40.332
they've been spreading all kinds of fake news.

255
16:40.416 --> 16:43.293
Yes. All I care about right now is finding Chiara.

256
16:43.377 --> 16:44.211
That's all.

257
17:03.731 --> 17:05.357
Mikoy, can I talk to you?

258
17:05.941 --> 17:07.276
Why?

259
17:07.359 --> 17:08.694
Is this about Chiara?

260
17:09.486 --> 17:12.197
It might be better if we talk in private.

261
17:12.281 --> 17:13.323
No, it's okay.

262
17:13.824 --> 17:14.992
They're family.

263
17:15.701 --> 17:16.535
Why?

264
17:22.416 --> 17:24.668
When I learned that you and Chiara had settled here,

265
17:24.752 --> 17:26.211
I had everyone profiled and monitored,

266
17:26.295 --> 17:28.756
just to make sure there wouldn't be any problems.

267
17:28.839 --> 17:30.591
Have everyone here background-checked.

268
17:30.674 --> 17:32.926
Everyone around Mikoy.

269
17:33.010 --> 17:34.219
Everyone?

270
17:34.303 --> 17:35.512
Everyone.

271
17:35.596 --> 17:37.598
From Pepe to Rahmboy.

272
17:38.599 --> 17:40.142
At first, we didn't find anything.

273
17:41.351 --> 17:43.520
Until Mrs. Corales came along.

274
17:44.021 --> 17:44.897
Mom?

275
17:51.820 --> 17:53.530
When Dara did a background check on her,

276
17:53.614 --> 17:55.491
she had worked for years in a part of Italy

277
17:55.574 --> 17:58.327
where the Concordat has a strong presence.

278
18:00.662 --> 18:01.914
At first,

279
18:01.997 --> 18:03.791
we thought it might just be a coincidence.

280
18:05.250 --> 18:08.212
Until we dug deeper and found that she had a connection to La Morte Bianca.

281
18:08.295 --> 18:10.964
She is her personal housekeeper.

282
18:13.801 --> 18:14.760
Wait.

283
18:14.843 --> 18:16.053
What are you saying?

284
18:22.559 --> 18:24.186
And the same goes for Rahmboy.

285
18:24.269 --> 18:25.979
What about him?

286
18:26.063 --> 18:27.523
This is insane!

287
18:27.606 --> 18:28.607
This is such a mess!

288
18:29.191 --> 18:30.567
We have reason to believe

289
18:30.651 --> 18:33.570
that all this time, the Concordat has never stopped keeping an eye on you.

290
18:35.656 --> 18:37.825
Then we need to do everything we can to get her back.

291
18:40.536 --> 18:42.121
-It's not that easy? -You don't understand.

292
18:42.204 --> 18:43.413
-Mikoy! -You listen to me!

293
18:43.497 --> 18:45.124
When you asked me for help,

294
18:45.207 --> 18:46.750
-I agreed. -Wait, what’s going on?

295
18:46.834 --> 18:48.627
I gave everything to the agency. Everything!

296
18:48.710 --> 18:50.045
-Just a second, Mikoy. -Mikoy.

297
18:50.129 --> 18:51.588
-You owe me. -Calm down, Mikoy.

298
18:51.672 --> 18:53.215
For all the sacrifices I've made.

299
18:53.841 --> 18:55.175
Now I'm coming to collect.

300
18:55.259 --> 18:57.719
-Mikoy. -The person that I love

301
18:57.803 --> 18:59.263
needs my help.

302
19:01.849 --> 19:02.850
Mikoy.

303
19:22.661 --> 19:23.954
Dear.

304
19:25.414 --> 19:26.748
Why do you look so worried?

305
19:30.419 --> 19:33.422
Does Chiara really have to lead the Concordat?

306
19:39.219 --> 19:41.889
You know we don't have a choice.

307
19:43.140 --> 19:46.143
Chiara is the only one who can become the queen of the Concordat.

308
19:47.311 --> 19:50.981
Chiara is the only one who can bring the mafia leaders to their knees.

309
19:53.192 --> 19:54.443
She's so happy now.

310
19:55.319 --> 19:56.945
She's happy here,

311
19:57.029 --> 19:58.197
with Mikoy and the others.

312
19:58.739 --> 19:59.656
Isn't she?

313
20:17.216 --> 20:18.634
I was happy once too.

314
20:24.431 --> 20:26.975
And that made me realize

315
20:27.768 --> 20:29.770
that real happiness

316
20:30.729 --> 20:33.357
isn't about being loved or loving someone.

317
20:43.575 --> 20:46.745
Being at the top, where no one can bring you down.

318
20:47.621 --> 20:48.664
But, Mom…

319
20:49.164 --> 20:51.250
What if Chiara really doesn't want it anymore?

320
20:54.002 --> 20:57.631
I'll destroy every reason she has to be happy.

321
20:58.382 --> 21:01.426
I'll personally put an end to Mikoy Pinagpala.

322
21:08.934 --> 21:09.893
Whose could this be?

323
21:11.478 --> 21:12.813
Someone from outside!

324
21:15.649 --> 21:16.775
Come on. Let's find out.

325
21:30.539 --> 21:33.125
Ma'am. Sorry to bother you.

326
21:34.584 --> 21:36.378
We found a motorcycle outside.

327
21:36.461 --> 21:39.214
Looks like we may have an unauthorized visitor.

328
21:59.026 --> 22:01.528
You need to fulfill your promise.

329
22:02.446 --> 22:04.281
Take the throne.

330
22:06.199 --> 22:09.077
He plans to use Mikoy's life,

331
22:09.161 --> 22:10.287
his family,

332
22:10.370 --> 22:12.789
even the people he loves against you

333
22:12.873 --> 22:15.125
if you go through with the wedding.

334
22:24.634 --> 22:25.719
You know,

335
22:25.802 --> 22:28.346
this thing about royal families,

336
22:28.430 --> 22:31.099
they marry for power.

337
22:31.933 --> 22:33.977
So if you become his wife,

338
22:34.061 --> 22:37.314
no one will challenge his position anymore.

339
22:38.023 --> 22:41.151
His position as head of the Concordat will be secure.

340
22:42.486 --> 22:43.987
To put an end to this,

341
22:44.071 --> 22:45.864
you need to kill

342
22:45.947 --> 22:48.200
whatever he's blackmailing you with,

343
22:48.283 --> 22:50.202
or the blackmailer himself.

344
22:50.285 --> 22:51.620
Choose.

345
22:57.918 --> 23:01.671
Is this really the only way to protect you, Mikoy?

346
23:03.757 --> 23:05.884
To go back to who I used to be?

347
23:23.193 --> 23:24.402
-Sir Mario? -Rahmboy.

348
23:26.363 --> 23:27.656
-Rahmboy. -I know.

349
23:29.407 --> 23:30.700
I’m just following orders.

350
23:31.910 --> 23:32.744
Rahmboy.

351
23:32.828 --> 23:33.745
I have a hunch.

352
23:33.829 --> 23:34.788
What hunch?

353
23:35.622 --> 23:37.457
I think Dad Mario knows something.

354
23:37.541 --> 23:40.210
He may have seen something or followed someone.

355
23:44.047 --> 23:45.674
But why didn't he tell me?

356
23:45.757 --> 23:47.509
He's trying to protect you, Mikoy.

357
23:47.592 --> 23:49.553
He's trying to be a good father to you.

358
23:52.639 --> 23:54.182
Chiara!

359
23:54.266 --> 23:55.267
What happened?

360
23:55.350 --> 23:57.227
Rio has already sent someone to kill you.

361
23:57.310 --> 23:58.353
You need to do what he says!

362
23:58.436 --> 23:59.563
Kill Rio.

363
23:59.646 --> 24:01.439
So you and Mikoy can finally be free.

364
24:04.401 --> 24:05.735
I'll handle him.

365
24:19.541 --> 24:20.709
We need you here.

366
24:23.003 --> 24:24.004
Let’s go.
